UID:10001061-1790294400-1790467199@bird-in-hand.com
SUMMARY:Bird-in-Hand Hot Air Balloon Festival
DESCRIPTION:We’re taking our favorite high-flying\, family-friendly fun fall event to new heights! \nWe’re thrilled to partner with Balloon Shows USA to bring you an all-new balloon festival. Enjoy a weekend of spectacular hot air balloon glows and laser light shows\, music\, family activities\, food trucks\, craft vendors and more. \nYou’ll find lots to do in the afternoon and evening. Ascend in a tethered balloon\, weather permitting. Browse our retailers’ offerings. If you’re bringing little ones\, take a wagon ride\, visit our kids’ area\, and let them burn off some energy in the bounce houses. Grab a bite to eat from our food trucks; each will offer a special bacon-themed dish in addition to its regular menu. \nAt 8:30\, the lights come on and the fun kicks into high gear. Watch as massive tethered hot air balloons illuminate the night and state-of-the-art laser displays paint the sky with brilliant colors. It’s an unforgettable sight and an experience you won’t want to miss. \nWhat to expect: \n\nMassive balloons and special shaped balloons guaranteed to delight kids and adults alike.\nCheck your bucket list and get a ride in a real tethered balloon ($35\, weather permitting).\nHigh-energy entertainment all evening with our DJ.\nShop\, explore and discover craft and retail vendors with unique finds and handmade goods.\nSatisfy your cravings at our food truck festival\, featuring special bacon-themed creations from select vendors.\nTake in the scenery and enjoy our farm with free hayrides.\nDon’t miss the Kids Zone with games\, rides\, bounce houses and nonstop fun ($5 to $20 for unlimited rides).\nThe Grand Finale (8:30 pm nightly) with Balloon Glow & Laser Show\, music and synchronized balloon burn\, giant glowing balloons and crowd countdowns\n\nDates: Friday\, September 25\, 2026 & Saturday\, September 26\, 2026\nTime: 3 pm–10 pm both days\nGrand Finale: 8:30 pm \nTickets:  \nIn advance\nVIP: $45/day\nAdults: $25/day\nKids (6-12): $15/day\nKids (5 and under): FREE \nTickets will be available at the gate for an additional cost. \nGet tickets now before we sell out. \nClick here to order tickets \n 
URL:https://bird-in-hand.com/event/bird-in-hand-hot-air-balloon-festival/
LOCATION:Bird-in-Hand Event Field\, 320 North Ronks Road\, Bird-in-Hand\, 17505\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bird-in-hand.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/2026BalloonEventHeader.jpg
